WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Living Proof Verification™. Same hallway. Two controllers. Measured.
Unitree G1 · walk-hallway · 20 seeds per controller · pass bar 18/20

00:05.000 --> 00:17.000
Seed 15: same start, same command, 0.5 m/s for 5.5 m. Both controllers fail.

00:17.000 --> 00:24.500
Seed 1: same start, same command. Both controllers pass.

00:24.500 --> 00:33.500
All 20 seeds, side by side. Teal = PASS. Amber = FAIL (side-wall contact or drifted beyond the lateral limit).

00:33.500 --> 00:38.500
The tally (snapshot recorded 1 Nov 2026): passes count up against a bar of 18/20.

00:38.500 --> 00:43.500
Snapshot recorded 1 Nov 2026: Unitree stock 1.1.0 12/20 FAIL (95% interval 39–78%), Playground 1.0.0 13/20 FAIL (95% interval 43–82%).
Neither clears the bar. Latest results: docs.livingprooflabs.com/livingproof-verification/

00:43.500 --> 00:47.000
Chapter 2: Will this work for my robot?

00:47.000 --> 00:56.000
Same hallway. Different bodies. MuJoCo simulation, one specification, any robot that fits it.

00:56.000 --> 01:00.000
Humanoids. Quadrupeds. Your robot next.

